 {"startPos": 385,
  "moduleName": "Lean.Util.Trace",
  "kind": "definition",
  "fullName": "Lean.registerTraceClass",
  "endPos": 403,
  "detail":
  "```lean\nLean.registerTraceClass (traceClassName : Name) (inherited : Bool := false) (ref : Name := by exact decl_name%) :\n  IO Unit\n```\n***\nRegisters a trace class.\n\nBy default, trace classes are not inherited;\nthat is, `set_option trace.foo true` does not imply `set_option trace.foo.bar true`.\nCalling ``registerTraceClass `foo.bar (inherited := true)`` enables this inheritance\non an opt-in basis.\n\n***\n*import Lean.Util.Trace*",
  "definitionStartPos": {"line": 279, "column": 4},
  "definitionPath":
  "/Users/hattoriseiji/.elan/toolchains/leanprover--lean4---v4.10.0-rc2/src/lean/Lean/Util/Trace.lean",
  "definitionEndPos": {"line": 279, "column": 22}},
